	(text_box "ESP32 S3 module integration guidelines : \n- 90Ohm DP target for the USB, no crossing other signals\n- Capacitor buttons are optional\n- 10K pullup to EN with 1uF cap as per dev kit C 1.1 implementation\n- Reserved GPIOs (do not use) : 26->32\n- Strapping IOs : 0-3-45-46\n"
